.Dd July 17, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-PAGESERVER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-pageserver , rgopageserver
.Nd NomadNet-style page and file server
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm pageserver
.Op Fl config Ar file
.Op Fl pages-dir Ar dir
.Op Fl files-dir Ar dir
.Op Fl node-name Ar name
.Op Fl announce-interval Ar minutes
.Op Fl identity Ar path
.Op Fl no-page-stats
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Serves static pages under
.Pa /page/
and files under
.Pa /file/
over Reticulum request handlers, suitable for NomadNet-style clients.
.Pp
Default pages and files directories are
.Pa pages
and
.Pa files
relative to the current working directory.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
